# --- Email (choose ONE option) ---
# Option A (recommended for quick setup): Gmail SMTP App Password
# 1) Enable 2‑Step Verification on your Google account
# 2) Generate an App Password for “Mail”
# 3) Put the values in backend/.env (NOT in .env.example) and restart backend
# EMAIL_USER=yourgmail@gmail.com
# EMAIL_PASS=your_16_char_app_password

# Backward-compatible names (older versions)
# GMAIL_USER=yourgmail@gmail.com
# GMAIL_PASS=your_16_char_app_password

# Option B: Gmail OAuth2 (matches the variables you already have in your root .env)
